        "zh": "外呼时间:精确到分钟.如果两个字段都存在值，以该字段为准。建议用该字段，精确到分钟, 08:31-12:05 13:33-19:00 则传[[\"08:31\",\"12:05\"][\"13:33\",\"19:00\"]]；默认为[[\"08:00\",\"20:00\"]]",
        "en": "The outbound call time, accurate to the minute. If both fields have values, this field takes precedence. Use this field for minute-level precision. For example, to specify 08:31-12:05 and 13:33-19:00, pass [[\"08:31\",\"12:05\"][\"13:33\",\"19:00\"]]. Default value: [[\"08:00\",\"20:00\"]]."
